            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"orderId\": {{orderId}},\n  \"paymentMethod\": \"CARD\"\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/payments",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "payments"]
            },
            "description": "Process a payment for an existing PENDING order. **Requires authentication.**\n\n**Body**\n- `orderId` (integer, required) — must be a positive integer\n- `paymentMethod` (string, required) — one of: `CARD`, `UPI`, `NET_BANKING`\n\nA unique `paymentReference` is generated automatically. Returns `404` if the order does not belong to the authenticated user, `409` if the order was already paid."
          },
          "response": [
